Package: lafa
Version: 0.1.2
Section: education
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 0
Maintainer: Edukasaun OS <dev@edukasaun.org>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pyqt5, libqt5svg5, python3-keyring, python3-secretstorage, xdg-utils, libglib2.0-bin, fonts-noto-color-emoji, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: edukasaun-desktop-menu (>= 0.9.24), espeak-ng, alsa-utils, poppler-utils, papirus-icon-theme, gnome-keyring, network-manager-gnome, pavucontrol-qt, pcmanfm-qt, system-config-printer, screengrab, libreoffice
Homepage: https://github.com/hugomonizdorego/Eduka-Lafa
Description: LAFA - learning assistant and virtual companion for Edukasaun OS
 LAFA Desktop is a complete school room: teachers for every subject with free
 resources and offline practice, homework and timetable, library, computer
 lab, notice board and Edukasaun OS help. The LAFA Virtual Assistant is an
 animated crocodile from Timor-Leste that walks on the Eduka-Panel, changes
 activities and outfits (Tais Mane, Tuxedo, Casual) and asks how it can help.
 Settings are in Eduka-Settings -> Lafa-Configuration. No LAFA server: it uses
 the internet, public open sources and optional AI providers (free Ollama).
